{"id":"chatcmpl-82772b0db7a7a54d","object":"chat.completion","created":1788642354,"model":"qwen38flashnext","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"\n\nThe process by which plants make food is **photosynthesis**.\n\n**Chemical equation:**\n\n\\[\n6CO_2 + 6H_2O \\xrightarrow{\\text{sunlight, chlorophyll}} C_6H_{12}O_6 + 6O_2\n\\]\n\nThat is, carbon dioxide and water, in the presence of sunlight and chlorophyll, form glucose and oxygen.","refusal":null,"annotations":null,"audio":null,"function_call":null,"reasoning":"We need answer user: \"Name the process by which plants make food and give its chemical equation.\" Simple biology. Need final concise. Process photosynthesis. Equation: 6CO2 + 6H2O ->(sunlight, chlorophyll) C6H12O6 + 6O2. Could include glucose. Ensure correct.\n"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop","stop_reason":null,"token_ids":null,"routed_experts":null}],"service_tier":null,"system_fingerprint":"vllm-0.28.1rc1.dev446+g798544433-tp4-ep-72ccc4a5","usage":{"prompt_tokens":66,"total_tokens":231,"completion_tokens":165,"prompt_tokens_details":null,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":73}},"prompt_logprobs":null,"prompt_token_ids":null,"prompt_text":null,"kv_transfer_params":null,"ec_transfer_params":null,"metrics":null}